OL,3,GNEWSAMan broke pensioner's back with
OL,4,A'despicable' push
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who broke a 78-year-old woman's
OL,7,Fwrist and back when he pushed her over,
OL,8,Fcausing a "devastating" decline in her
OL,9,Fdementia, has been jailed for two and a
OL,10,Fhalf years.
OL,12,FDean McLellan, 38, shoved the woman
OL,13,Fshortly after she appeared to give him
OL,14,Fmoney to buy something from a corner
OL,15,Fshop, Newcastle Crown Court heard.
OL,17,FThe victim's daughter said her mother
OL,18,Fpreviously enjoyed life but had
OL,19,Fundergone a "massive change" because of
OL,20,Fthe attack, adding: "Mam is not the
OL,21,Fhappy person she was."
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
